<title>INDONESIA: Barito 1996 net up to 87.28 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Barito 1996 net up to 87.28 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			  87.28 vs  70.12</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    62   vs  50</p>
<p>    Net sales			 951.31  vs  817.82</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    182.68  vs  123.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 64.78  vs   16.10</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  144.16  vs  111.80</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     401.43  vs  385.54</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Barito Pacific Timber is one of Indonesia's largest timber firms.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
